          "child_node": "foot_joint_l",
          "joint_type": "ball"
        },
        {
          "joint_id": "foot_r",
          "parent_node": "ankle_r",
          "child_node": "foot_joint_r",
          "joint_type": "ball"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Topology reference only; Si-Dan product evidence confirms ball joints on arms, legs, feet and neck but public measurements do not establish dimensions."
      ]
    },
